# Who may approve a correction to the delivery agreement (REQ-GHUB-174).
#
# The configuration gate refuses a declared correction whose approver is
# not a code owner of the file it is declared in, matched through
# each asset's people.yaml `github:` field - both files read as they stood
# at the BASE of the change, so a change cannot make its own approver.
#
# REQUIRING these owners' review before a merge is a GitHub
# branch-protection setting, not something this file can switch on. It is
# OFF in this proof of concept; see docs/code-owner-review.md for what a
# real deployment turns on.
/assets/*/calendar.yaml   @keithamoss
/assets/*/data-asset.yaml @keithamoss
/assets/*/people.yaml     @keithamoss
/.github/CODEOWNERS       @keithamoss
